{"id":"691811637","kind":"article","title":"数学中的沉默宣言会是什么样的？","author":"Issa Rice","original_authors":["Issa Rice"],"original_source_urls":["https://wiki.issarice.com/wiki/What_would_a_vow_of_silence_look_like_for_math?"],"publisher":"Jarrett Ye","column":"Issawiki & Learning","date":"2024-04-11","updated":"2026-10-27","votes":13,"comment_count":0,"minutes":1,"chars":256,"keywords":["数学教育","游戏化学习","概念形成","Braid"],"summary":"这则短译文借《Braid》不预先命名游戏物体的做法，提出数学游戏或可不先给概念下定义，而让玩家在操作中逐步构建机制和理解。","zhihu_url":"https://zhuanlan.zhihu.com/p/691811637","restoration":null,"toc":[{"id":"sec-1","level":3,"title":"链接到本文"}],"html":"<p data-pid=\"17-5T0bk\">数学中的「<a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://wiki.issarice.com/wiki/Vow_of_silence\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">沉默宣言</a>」<sup class=\"cite\" id=\"cite-1\"><a href=\"#ref-1\">[1]</a></sup>会是什么样的？也许我们不能真的沉默，但我们可以做到不去下定义。Hamish Todd 在他的 Braid 直播里提到，Braid 从来不给游戏里的物体取名字，用户必须自己给这些物体取名。</p><p data-pid=\"_ZYz7Fxm\">数学游戏可能也类似，游戏里一切事物都是逐步构建的机制，没有什么是预先定义/命名的。</p><h3 id=\"sec-1\">链接到本文</h3><ul><li data-pid=\"gZydapU0\"><a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://wiki.issarice.com/wiki/Vow_of_silence\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">沉默宣言</a> </li></ul><p class=\"ztext-empty-paragraph\"><br/></p><blockquote data-pid=\"er8Rf4Fn\"><a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"http://paratranz.cn/projects/3131\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Thoughts Memo</a> 汉化组译制<br/>感谢主要译者 Shom、校对 Jarrett Ye<br/>原文：<a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://wiki.issarice.com/wiki/What_would_a_vow_of_silence_look_like_for_math?\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">What would a vow of silence look like for math?</a></blockquote><hr/><ol class=\"references\"><li id=\"ref-1\"><a aria-label=\"返回正文\" class=\"ref-back\" href=\"#cite-1\">↩</a> 沉默宣言 <a class=\"tm-internal\" data-tm-id=\"693158407\" href=\"#/post/693158407\">站内阅读 ↗</a></li></ol>","rec_chain":[{"id":"666393432","title":"可探索媒介中的有限性假设","author":"Issa Rice","votes"